Provenance / 来源说明

The QQ Zone protocol layer in `client.py` is derived from
`astrbot_plugin_qzone` by Zhalslar:

    https://github.com/Zhalslar/astrbot_plugin_qzone

The original project ships a `LICENSE` file containing the GNU General
Public License v3.0. Its README badge says MIT, so the original project
has an internal licensing discrepancy; this plugin follows the LICENSE
file (GPLv3), which is the stricter and safer reading. The original
README also credits the CampuxBot project for part of its code:

    https://github.com/idoknow/CampuxBot

Original work added by this plugin:

- scheduling loops, dry-run mode, config and page Web APIs
- image pipeline: stock-image selection, generated images, dynamic
  image prompts, weather/time context, group-chat material
- integration with the persona-card and draw plugins
- JSON state, comment de-duplication, and failure fallbacks

If the original author clarifies a different license, this NOTICE and
the README should be updated accordingly.
